    "text": "NOTIFICATION MADE UNDER SECTION 66c(4) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE AMENDED BY THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 22 OF 2012",
