      458.05,
      542.53,
      519.52
    ],
    "text": "AS per the powers entrusted to me under Section 66c(4) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance amended by the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, I, Sarangika Kalhari Jayasundara, the Commissioner of Local Government in the Western Province do hereby announce that the first meeting held for the purpose of electing Chairman, Deputy Chairman for the Local Government Authority of the Western Province stated in the schedule hereto under will be held on the date correspondingly set out under the same schedule at the time and place specified therein.",
